## Model card

- **Name:** LongCat 2.5 Preview, including Zen Free access.
- **Release:** September 25, 2026; image understanding, reasoning and coding workflows advertised. Cutoff and parameter count not verified. [Publisher changelog](https://longcat.chat/platform/docs/ChangeLog.html)
- **Provider / IDs:** Native `LongCat-2.5-Preview`, OpenAI-compatible Chat Completions and Anthropic Messages; 1M context, 128K output. [API quickstart](https://longcat.chat/platform/docs/)
- **Zen route:** `opencode/longcat-2.5-preview-free`, Chat Completions. Input/output/cache free for a limited period; provider promises zero retention and no model training on data for this route. [Zen documentation](https://opencode.ai/docs/zen/)
- **Modalities:** Publisher claims text/image understanding, text output; thinking toggle documented. [Publisher integration guide](https://longcat.chat/platform/docs/OpenCode.html)
- **Architecture:** No verified public weights, license or architecture specification found. No paid native tariff verified in primary sources retrieved here.

### Raw benchmarks found

No verified public quality score found for this exact preview. Searches checked publisher documentation, hosted-provider listings and benchmark queries. TokenDyno has no successful throughput samples or intelligence result; its displayed zero reliability is not a model-quality benchmark. [Direct monitoring page](https://tokendyno.com/models/opencode-zen/longcat-2.5-preview-free/)

GPQA, HLE, Terminal-Bench, Tau, GDPval, MCP-Atlas, SWE-bench, LiveCodeBench, SciCode, Vibe Code Bench and measured long-context retrieval: no verified public score found. Qualitative demos and unsourced cross-model claims are insufficient to assign normalized scores.

